		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Réponse à&#160;:  Affichage des messages d'erreurs]]></title>
		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=26599#p26599"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Bonsoir et merci.<br />J&#039;ai ajouté une variable d&#039;environnement et cela a résout le problème:</p><p>LC_MESSAGES&#160; valeur English</p><p>Voir ici:<br /><a href="https://stackoverflow.com/questions/31605837/change-language-of-the-postgressql-server-error-messages-to-english" rel="nofollow">https://stackoverflow.com/questions/316 … to-english</a></p><p>Résultat:</p><div class="codebox"><pre><code>C:\Users\Administrateur&gt;psql -h localhost -U postgres
psql (9.6.6)
WARNING: Console code page (850) differs from Windows code page (1252)
         8-bit characters might not work correctly. See psql reference
         page &quot;Notes for Windows users&quot; for details.
Type &quot;help&quot; for help.

postgres=# \c cave bob
WARNING: Console code page (850) differs from Windows code page (1252)
         8-bit characters might not work correctly. See psql reference
         page &quot;Notes for Windows users&quot; for details.
You are now connected to database &quot;cave&quot; as user &quot;bob&quot;.
cave=&gt; \q</code></pre></div><p>Cordialement.</p>]]></content>
